# tally 2.2 (CHANGES.md 2.2-3, choice C-5), L §4.6, §8.3 LOAD-INSTANT: a balance reading at a bare day is refused,
# and the message offers the two instants that load: `needs start or end` (2.1.8: `needs start, end or after`).
=== m.tally
model t
  tally 2
  on 2026-12-31
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source s "s"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
place konto: accounts PLN lives 2025-01-01..
place world: outside lives 1900-01-01..
input amt: money PLN
input dom: int

move pay[m in months]: transfers
  on day_of(m, dom)
  at start_of(m)
  leg cash from konto to world amount amt

version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2025-01-01
  anchor konto
  amt = 100.00 PLN
  dom = 5
  opening[konto] = 1 000.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "s"
  stated[konto] = 900.00 PLN at 2026-01-31 "s"

ask q: bal(konto, 2026-01-31)
=== expect
refused: LOAD-INSTANT balance reading stated at 2026-01-31 needs start or end (m.tally:27)
